<p>You are so full with power that it overflows out of you whenever you cast a spell.</p><p>Upon spell cast you have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 13%, 18%, 21%, 25%</acronym> chances to boost the physical power, spellpower, mindpower and all saves of all friendly undeads in sight (including yourself) by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 23, 33, 42, 50</acronym> for 4 turns.</p>